{
    "name": "kspeeder",
    "display_name": "KSpeeder",
    "description": "KSpeeder 是 Docker 镜像加速专家，通过多镜像源并发下载、动态负载均衡与断点续传，大幅提升 Docker Hub、GHCR 等镜像仓库的拉取速度，并提供状态监控管理面板。",
    "category": "docker",
    "tags": [
        "docker",
        "镜像加速",
        "registry",
        "网络加速",
        "开源"
    ],
    "website": "https://kspeeder.com/",
    "source_url": "https://github.com/kspeeder/docker_kspeeder",
    "architectures": [
        "amd64",
        "arm64"
    ],
    "image": "linkease/kspeeder",
    "default_ports": [
        {
            "port": 5443,
            "protocol": "tcp",
            "description": "KSpeeder 主服务端口（镜像加速服务）"
        },
        {
            "port": 5003,
            "protocol": "tcp",
            "description": "管理监控面板 / CONNECT 代理端口"
        }
    ],
    "config_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
            "ports",
            "volumes",
            "kspeeder_env"
        ],
        "containers": [
            {
                "name": "kspeeder",
                "title": "KSpeeder",
                "settings": [
                    {
                        "type": "ports",
                        "title": "端口设置",
                        "fields": [
                            "ports"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "volumes",
                        "title": "存储空间设置",
                        "fields": [
                            "volumes"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "env",
                        "title": "环境变量",
                        "fields": [
                            "kspeeder_env"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "advanced",
                        "title": "高级设置",
                        "fields": [
                            "privileged"
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "description": "KSpeeder Docker 镜像加速服务"
            }
        ],
        "properties": {
            "ports": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "local_port",
                        "container_port",
                        "protocol"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                        "protocol": {
                            "enum": [
                                "tcp",
                                "udp"
                            ],
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "协议",
                            "default": "tcp"
                        },
                        "local_port": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "title": "本地端口",
                            "maximum": 65535,
                            "minimum": 1
                        },
                        "container_port": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "title": "容器端口",
                            "maximum": 65535,
                            "minimum": 1
                        }
                    }
                },
                "title": "端口设置",
                "default": [
                    {
                        "protocol": "tcp",
                        "local_port": 5443,
                        "container_port": 5443
                    },
                    {
                        "protocol": "tcp",
                        "local_port": 5003,
                        "container_port": 5003
                    }
                ]
            },
            "volumes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "host_path",
                        "container_path",
                        "mode"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                        "mode": {
                            "enum": [
                                "rw",
                                "ro"
                            ],
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "权限",
                            "default": "rw"
                        },
                        "host_path": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "本地路径",
                            "format": "directory"
                        },
                        "container_path": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "容器路径"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "title": "存储空间设置",
                "default": [
                    {
                        "mode": "rw",
                        "host_path": "kspeeder/data",
                        "container_path": "/kspeeder-data"
                    },
                    {
                        "mode": "rw",
                        "host_path": "kspeeder/config",
                        "container_path": "/kspeeder-config"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "privileged": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "title": "特权模式",
                "default": false,
                "description": "一般无需开启"
            },
            "kspeeder_env": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "key",
                        "value"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                        "key": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "变量名"
                        },
                        "value": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "值"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "title": "环境变量",
                "default": [
                    {
                        "key": "TZ",
                        "value": "Asia/Shanghai"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    },
    "yaml_template": "services:\n  kspeeder:\n    image: {{ image }}\n    container_name: {{ project_name }}\n    ports:\n{%- for port in ports %}\n      - \"{{ port.local_port }}:{{ port.container_port }}/{{ port.protocol }}\"\n{%- endfor %}\n    volumes:\n{%- for vol in volumes %}\n      - {{ to_host_path(vol.host_path if (vol.host_path.startswith('/') or vol.shared) else project_name ~ '/' ~ vol.host_path) }}:{{ vol.container_path }}:{{ vol.mode }}\n{%- endfor %}\n    privileged: {{ privileged | lower }}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    environment:\n{%- for item in kspeeder_env %}\n      - {{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}\n{%- endfor %}\n",
    "readme": "# KSpeeder\n\nKSpeeder 是 Docker 镜像加速专家，通过多镜像源并发下载、动态负载均衡与断点续传，大幅加速 Docker Hub、GHCR 等镜像仓库的访问，并提供状态监控管理面板。\n\n## 端口说明\n\n- `5443`：KSpeeder 主服务端口（镜像加速服务）。\n- `5003`：管理监控面板端口，同时支持作为 Docker daemon 的 HTTP/HTTPS CONNECT 代理。\n\n## 使用\n\n1. 部署完成后访问 `http://<NAS-IP>:5003` 查看管理面板与加速状态。\n2. 在 Docker 的镜像加速地址（registry-mirrors）中填入 `https://registry.linkease.net` 即可生效，可用 `docker info | grep registry.linkease.net` 验证。\n3. 若 NAS 的 Docker UI 不支持填写带端口的加速地址，可将 Docker daemon 的 HTTP_PROXY/HTTPS_PROXY 指向 `http://<NAS-IP>:5003`（CONNECT 代理模式，详见官方文档）。\n\n## 说明\n\n配置目录 `/kspeeder-config` 首次启动会自动生成 `nodes.yaml` 示例，可编辑其中的镜像源与节点配置，修改后重启容器生效。",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "type": "compose",
    "changelog": "初始导入",
    "backup_paths": [
        "/kspeeder-config"
    ],
    "is_builtin": false
}
